Claude Security (claude-security)
=================================

This product is an unofficial port of Codex Security to Claude Code.

It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by OpenAI or Anthropic.
"Codex" is a product name of OpenAI. "Claude" and "Claude Code" are product
names of Anthropic. Both are used here only to identify the software this port
derives from and the runtime it targets.


